"file_name": "KV\u5efa\u6a21\u7248-\u6a2a\u7248\u5e26\u6587\u6848.png", "id": "2933852970137565", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_2933852973470898_1269573226902913604_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xsPQyr_lcIkQ7kNvwH0705B&_nc_oc=Ado5B6_o3nPXIbaGVO2KA3i69fl74DLpur7WEPzXq7KL2dDOLB797hnpz3_Un5hWang&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5CvE_8WE2mKKq5R6rdLg2DWR2cpBw_-b43RGMzd3X5Sg&oe=69FDE6A1"}, "display_name": "Grab & Run Alpaca party", "keywords": ["hangout", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "##  This is ** Grab & Run**, the physics-powered extraction multiplayer VR adventure where maps reshape every time, every stuff has real weight, monsters keep you alert, and an upgrade system makes each run hit even better, while you and your friends stay just the right amount of chaotic, and new surprises drop all the time.\n\n---\n---\n\n\n## \ud83c\udf92 **Grab \u2192 Fight \u2192 Return Loop**\nEnter room \u2192 grab shiny stuff \u2192 fight monsters \u2192 push stuff home, classic extraction loop, Alpaca edition.  \nThe more valuable the grab, the harder it gets.  **High risk. Big shiny.**\n\n---\n{1410467900510234}\n\n## \u2699\ufe0f **Physics Chaos**\nEverything heavy. Everything move. Push cart fast, stuff fly off.  \nNot bug, physics working hard.  Too heavy? Roll it into cart. \n\nEfficiency? Maybe. Fun? Definitely.\n\n---\n{1579468509903297}\n\n## \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f **Every run is a new world**\nNew room combos, new routes, new monsters, every single run.  \nYou might get a little lost and run into wandering monsters, just consider it part of the adventure.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udc79 **Many Monster. Then BIG BOSS.**\nDifferent monsters wander around.  Every few levels, big boss show up.  \nGet friends and fight together. Fun.\n\n---\n{847706171298747}\n\n## \ud83d\udcaa **Get coins, get stronger**\nGrab coins to upgrade your stats, boost your runs, and become big strong alpaca.  \nMore gear, more builds, more chaos coming.  **Final form not reached yet.**\n\n\n{25371341385839390}\n---\n## \ud83d\udd27 **Feedback & Updates**\nWe update the game often and keep improving it based on your feedback.  \nYou speak, we hear. Join our Discord, play with the community:  \n**discord.gg/fXzg8gwrpr**\n\n\n", "short_description": "This is Grab & Run, the physics-powered extraction multiplayer VR adventure where maps reshape every time, every stuff has real weight, monsters keep you alert, and an upgrade system makes each run hit even better, while you and your friends stay just the right amount of chaotic, new surprises drop all the time."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1G2lTbooVez5146G8ER7dBPNAw-xLTALwRUWbCwmp9j4/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Netvios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://netvios.163.com/en/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": [], "id": "25407354645602759"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1562344358151926"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1562344358151926"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1769166780, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1562344358151926"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26510597405278472", "version": "1.13.33"}, "id": "4201197503539639", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26510597405278472"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": "Added new monster\u3010The Shy Lady\u3011\nMonster trait: She doesn't want to be seen. If the player stares at her, she will notice and chase the player at extremely high speed. If the player turns their back to her, her movement speed will be greatly reduced.\n\nAdded cabinets to many rooms\nPlayers can now open cabinets and search for treasures hidden inside.\n\nDoors now block the path between rooms\nDoors can block the line of sight of monsters from other rooms. However, players won't know if there's a monster in the next room until they open the door.\n\nAdded more hideable tables and chairs in rooms\nMonsters will have a harder time sensing players when they are crouching.\n\nOptimized treasure generation mechanics\nTreasures will now be more diverse and more treasures will be generated in each level (including treasures hidden in cabinets). Each level will roughly generate 4\u20135 times the value of the required mission treasures.\n\nAdded weapons to the shop\nPlayers can now purchase weapons directly from the shop, including: Pistol, Shotgun, Tranquilizer Gun, Electromagnetic Gun, Flamethrower, Freeze Gun, and melee weapons.\n\nOptimized monster physics movement logic\nMonsters will now react more dramatically when hit by weapons.\n\nAdded shatter effects to all treasures and interactable objects in the scene", "created_date": 1777492495, "id": "26510597405278472", "version": "1.13.33", "version_code": 325, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26510586671946212"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26510597405278472"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": "1\u3001Fixed an issue where elevators occasionally had no collision.\n2\u3001Added auto-matchmaking (automatically joins rooms that are not full).\n3\u3001Added lobby hoverboard feature.", "created_date": 1776341477, "id": "26359491310389083", "version": "1.13.17", "version_code": 309, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26359459690392245"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26510597405278472"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": "- Resolve the Discord connection issue.\n- Incorporate new props.\n- Rectify room generation errors and minimum completion problems.\n- Multiple \"Retreat Button stations\" have been added to the beginner's tutorial.\n- In-game questionnaires and questionnaire rewards have been introduced.", "created_date": 1775218710, "id": "26224510210553861", "version": "1.13.10", "version_code": 302, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26224463263891889"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26510597405278472"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": "- Incorporate a user personalization settings panel.\n- Introduce new weapons and items.\n- Implement an equipment bar for item storage.\n- Increase Discord - related activities.\n- Add a new level theme, namely Cinema.\n- Introduce novice guidance levels and adjust the tutorial level flow.\n- Improve the presentation of special effects and monster animations.\n- Enhance the performance of scene assets and update scene model resources.\n- Improve the feedback and performance of game sound effects.\n- Fix and refine existing issues.", "created_date": 1774639126, "id": "26152222077782675", "version": "1.13.5", "version_code": 296, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26152198981118318"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24653500707654827", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26510597405278472"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "4201197503539639"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1773303290, "id": "25994580320213519", "version": "1.11.31b", "version_code": 295, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "25994572236880994"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}